{"type":"npc","name":"Sealed Mummy","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":64,"temp":0,"max":64,"details":"void healing"},"ac":{"value":26,"details":"void healing"},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":10,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":40}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"alchemical","value":10,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"fire","value":10,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["necril"],"details":"Plus any one language they knew when they were alive"},"level":{"value":8},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Necromancers seeking resilient mummy guardians developed a ritual for creating mummies capable of using their own sarcophagi for defense, either as a shield to protect the mummy from damage or as an independent minion capable of fighting alongside the mummy. Either way, by fighting in concert with their sarcophagus, a sealed mummy is much more dangerous than a mere mummy guardian.</p><p>While many of the unfortunate individuals who become mummies are unwilling and arise with hatred for all living things, sealed mummies retain their memories and loyalties to those they once served. These mummies tend to be people who chose undeath in order to guard someone or something that inspired their eternal devotion, and they follow their liege or their ward beyond the grave.</p><h2>Unlidded</h2><p>A sealed mummy prizes their sarcophagus lid, which often bears a likeness of themselves as they were in life, above all else. When their sarcophagus lid is broken, a sealed mummy sometimes go berserk with rage, abandoning all other goals beyond seeking revenge on those who defaced their precious lid.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 64/140/250 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing, slashing), armor (heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Occultism)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> constitution, death, energy resistant (void), force, intelligence, sensory (darkvision), strength, sturdy, throwing, unholy, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Javier Roque","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":2}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":16,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":15},"athletics":{"base":18},"occultism":{"base":16}},"traits":{"value":["mummy","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"g8YuMWTr9gu42UCs","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/sealed-mummy.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Sealed Mummy","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/sealed-mummy.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/sealed-mummy.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"void-healing","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"SUqZ4zy65J6nS4tR"},{"type":"action","name":"Alchemical Weakness","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The sealed mummy's weakness to alchemical items not only applies to damage from alchemical items, but the sealed mummy also takes @Damage[10[untyped]] damage when splashed with non-damaging alchemical items or dosed with alchemical poisons, even if they're immune to their other effects.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"nrFqNadE5CBxjl1D","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Raise Lid","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The lid of the sealed mummy's sarcophagus is attached, and the lid isn't broken</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The sealed mummy raises their sarcophagus's lid defensively, using it as a shield. This grants them a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and allows them to use the Shield Block reaction with their lid instead of with a shield. While the lid is raised, the mummy loses their alchemical weakness.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Weakness","type":"alchemical","value":0,"mode":"remove","predicate":["self:effect:raise-a-shield"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false,"selfEffect":{"uuid":"Compendium.sf2e.equipment-effects.Item.2YgXoHvJfrDHucMr","name":"Effect: Raise a Shield"}},"effects":[],"_id":"a8u5p4bksSsP6TIw","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.3"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Shield Block","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ShieldBlock]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"shield-block","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.m4HQ2o5aPxjXf2kY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"7Y5fGvu28x40JvUn"},{"img":"icons/equipment/shield/round-wooden-boss-steel-yellow-blue.webp","name":"Sarcophagus Lid","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":"wooden-shield","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common","integrated":null},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":0},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"wooden-shield","bulk":{"value":1},"hp":{"value":64,"max":64},"hardness":8,"price":{"value":{}},"equipped":{"carryType":"held","handsHeld":1},"containerId":null,"size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unusual Wooden Shield","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/shields.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"acBonus":2,"grade":null,"runes":{"reinforcing":0},"specific":null,"speedPenalty":0,"subitems":[]},"type":"shield","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.equipment.Item.ezVp13Uw8cWW08Da","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.3"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"wNo0GQ82hVjA4Gp7"},{"type":"action","name":"Telekinetic Lift","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The sealed mummy attempts an Athletics check to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.PMbdMWc2QroouFGD]{Grapple} a creature they can see within 30 feet. The sealed mummy does not require a free hand to attempt this check, but they can only have one creature grappled by Telekinetic Lift at a time. On a success, in addition to the normal effects of Grapple, the creature is lifted in the air up to 20 feet off the ground (this is forced movement), and when the condition ends, it falls. The effect automatically ends if the sealed mummy moves.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"AJ7PGq5WJ82OCP2G","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Unseal","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> The lid of the sealed mummy's sarcophagus is attached, and the lid isn't broken</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The sealed mummy detaches their sarcophagus lid and animates the lid as a minion for up to 1 minute. The lid then takes its two actions for the turn. As a minion, the lid is a separate Medium creature with its own space and attacks, initially detaching from the sealed mummy in an adjacent square. The lid has a fly speed of 40 feet, AC 28, and its listed Hardness and Hit Points; this is typically Hardness 8, HP 64, and BT 32, but the lid might be missing Hit Points from the sealed mummy's previous Shield Blocks. The lid uses the mummy's saving throw values and has object immunities. It can make a lid bash Strike at +20 for 2d10 bludgeoning damage. If the lid ends a move action adjacent to the sealed mummy, the mummy can choose to Dismiss the effect as a free action, reattaching the lid. If the mummy does not attach the lid within 1 minute, it falls to the ground, and the sealed mummy can use an Interact action while adjacent to reattach it manually. While the lid is detached and acting as an independent minion, the sealed mummy can't use Raise Lid.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"detached-lid","toggleable":true,"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.SealedMummy.DetachedLid"},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"bludgeoning","dice":2,"die":"d8","modifier":9}},"attackModifier":20,"traits":["agile","unarmed"],"key":"Strike","slug":"fist","label":"PF2E.BattleForm.Attack.Fist","predicate":["detached-lid"]},{"category":"simple","damage":{"base":{"damageType":"bludgeoning","dice":2,"die":"d10","modifier":12}},"attackModifier":20,"key":"Strike","slug":"lid-bash","label":"BZES.SpecificRule.SealedMummy.LidBash","predicate":[{"not":"detached-lid"}]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false,"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"PT1M"}},"effects":[],"_id":"7ihPtQcUonRrhyqE","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.3"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Telekinetic Object","effects":[],"system":{"_